  "strings": [
    "Riding to death and ruin in relief of Minas Tirith.\u0000",
    "the Riders of Rohan smash into the heart of the Orc Army.\u0000",
    "Nothing upon the Fields of Pelennor can resist their fury.\u0000",
    "Beset on all sides by siege towers and great war beasts...\u0000",
    "Theoden's brave warriors must also overcome\u0000",
    "an endless tide of Orcs and Warg Riders.\u0000",
    "But should the Rohirrim do sufficient damage to Sauron's armies...\u0000",
    "surely the Witch-king shall be drawn forth.\u0000",
    "His defeat would turn the tide of battle.\u0000",
    "For it is said that fear binds them to his cause.\u0000"
  ]
